DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The lliissaa driver provides support for the ST LIS331DL 3-axis digital out‐
     put accelerometer.  A total of 3 sensors are provided, one for each axis
     (X, Y and Z).  Each reading from LIS331DL is represented by an 8-bit 2's
     complement number.

     Sensor values are made available through the HW_SENSORS sysctl(2) inter‐
     face, and can be monitored with the systat(1) _s_e_n_s_o_r_s view, sensorsd(8)
     and sysctl(8) _h_w_._s_e_n_s_o_r_s.

